                  "later-clock refetch after capture-reference commit reuses content but preserves observation identity",
                  "source descriptors must match the frozen positive metadata-route allowlist",
                  "raw redirect Location path checks reject dot-segment evasion before a second transport call",
                  "R2 capture rejects incoherent URLs and oversize compressed or decompressed bodies",
                  "transport requests pin approved addresses before connect and stream response limits"
                ],
                "leaf_count": 22
              }
            ],
